WEBVTT

00:23:59.657 --> 00:24:02.296
because you would have
to go back to the 1930s

00:24:02.320 --> 00:24:04.212
to have an analogous period.

00:24:04.236 --> 00:24:06.418
So what you --

00:24:06.442 --> 00:24:07.689
It is how you do that,

00:24:07.713 --> 00:24:11.521
but the capacity to learn, to invent,

00:24:11.545 --> 00:24:15.355
and to get, you know,
that leverage in decision-making,

00:24:15.379 --> 00:24:17.204
is greater than ever before.

00:24:17.228 --> 00:24:19.466
And that's the power of our time.

00:24:19.490 --> 00:24:22.259
Some will do it well,
some will do it poorly,

00:24:22.283 --> 00:24:25.704
but it really comes down
to do you have the understanding

00:24:25.728 --> 00:24:28.164
of those cause-effect relationships,

00:24:28.188 --> 00:24:30.823
so that you know
how to place the right bet.